      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait sorry, what do you mean by a 'goblin's pouch' or 'goblin-proof'? I'm just trying to understand the legal/financial part of the process. can you just explain the actual mechanics of how the money moves from my bank to the escrow and then to the seller?",
